module System

# The crossing from Revare's list to Mielia's, written in Revare because its receiver is Revare's list.
# The other direction, `xs.to[RA::List]()`, is in List.mie.

### Makes a Mielia list of the elements of a list from Revare code (a Revare library routine's result):
### `rf_list.to[List]()`.
### :returns: A new Mielia list of copies of the elements.
routine List[T].to[MI::System.List[T]]() -> MI::System.List[T]
    var result = MI::System.List[T](capacity: me.count.to[Int]())
    for element in me
        result.add_last(value: element)
    return steal result
